{"step_index":5287,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-23T16:14:17Z","thinking":"A high confidence score, coupled with strong brand similarity, triggers an automatic match, bypassing external checks. This shortcut assumes a highly reliable direct correlation between the shortage and warehouse items. The logic directly pairs the items without relying on further API calls.\n\n\nIt seems the system misclassifies items with high brand similarity but differing packaging as \"not found\" due to a low TF-IDF score. Investigating how the initial search function handles such cases is crucial. The goal is to determine the actual return values (scores, brand matches, and candidates) for a set of problematic item name combinations to diagnose the root cause of this misclassification.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":false,"Summary":"Inspect finder scores for the 8 items","UserFacing":false},"CodeContent":"import sys\nsys.path.insert(0, \".\")\nfrom src.fast_match.candidate_finder import FastCandidateFinder\nfrom src.extract.file_handler import read_input_files\nfrom pathlib import Path\n\nwh_files = list(Path(\"data/processes/PROC-008/input_warehouses\").glob(\"*.*\"))\nif not wh_files:\n    wh_files = list(Path(\"data/warehouses\").glob(\"*.*\"))\n\nprint(f\"Found {len(wh_files)} warehouse files.\")\nwh_data = read_input_files(wh_files, role=\"warehouse\")\n\ntarget_items = [\n    (\"سكينورين كريم\", \"الهضبة الاثنين نقدى0.pdf\"),\n    (\"زنكترون 30كبسولة س ج\", \"مخزن الحياة فارم اسكندريه-170.p\"),\n    (\"بالموكورت  25. مجم امبول س ج\", \"السلام شبين.pdf\"),\n    (\"كارنيفيتا ادفانس للرجال30كيس س ج\", \"مخزن الحياة فارم اسكندريه-170.p\"),\n    (\"ب ك ميرز كبسول س ج\", \"الهضبة الاثنين نقدى0.pdf\"),\n    (\"سينوبريل كواقراص س ج\", \"الهضبة الاثنين نقدى0.pdf\"),\n    (\"تادالاندرو5جم30قرص\", \"الهضبة الاثنين نقدى0.pdf\"),\n    (\"هيرو دي3+كي2 نقط\", \"كيور فارما خاص.pdf\")\n]\n\nfor target, target_wh in target_items:\n    # Find the warehouse\n    matched_wh_key = None\n    for k in wh_data.keys():\n        if target_wh[:8] in k:\n            matched_wh_key = k\n            break\n            \n    if not matched_wh_key:\n        print(f\"Warehouse {target_wh} not found!\")\n        continue\n        \n    items = wh_data[matched_wh_key]\n    finder = FastCandidateFinder()\n    wh_catalog = [{\"id\": f\"W-{i:05}\", \"name\": item.get(\"item_name_raw\", \"\")} for i, item in enumerate(items)]\n    finder.fit(wh_catalog)\n    \n    top_candidates = finder.search(target, top_k=5)\n    print(f\"\\n--- Item: [{target}] in [{matched_wh_key}] ---\")\n    for c in top_candidates[:3]:\n        print(f\"   Candidate: [{c['name']}] | Score: {c['score']:.3f} | BrandSim: {c.get('brand_sim', 0)}\")\n","Description":"Inspect FastCandidateFinder results","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\kakak\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\916274de-7f92-49fc-a0a8-d291664b474a\\scratch\\inspect_finder_scores.py","toolAction":"Writing finder inspection script","toolSummary":"Inspect finder scores for items"}}]}
